        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>SOSS 218 Invisible Door Hinges</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSOSS 218 hinges are for use on 1-3/4\" thick wood doors. Package includes one (1) hinge with matching finish  #10 x 1-1/2\" wood screws. When the door is closed, SOSS Invisible Hinges cannot be seen or tampered with. When opened, the riveted hinge pin is non-removable. The installed hinge is firmly anchored in a deep, full mortise, which assists the screws in supporting the door, assuring a stronger door hinge installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-Finish-ornate.jpg?v=1704442260\" width=\"230\" height=\"302\" border=\"0\" alt=\"SOSS 218 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available For <a href=\"/products/1-inch-thick-door-invisible-door-hinges-soss-208\"><b>1\" thick doors SOSS 208 Hinge</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/1-3-8-thick-door-invisible-door-hinge-soss-216\"><b>1-3/8\" Thick Doors SOSS 216 Hinge</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/2-inch-thick-door-invisible-door-hinge-soss-220\"><b>2\" Thick Doors SOSS 220 Hinge</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the SOSS 218 Invisible Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Minimum 1-3/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: High Strength Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/218.pdf?v=1704262260\" target=\"new\"><b>SOSS 218 Hinge Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually (1 Door Hinge)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Invisible Door Hinge for 1-3/4 Inch Thick Doors, SOSS 218",
                "description": "SOSS 218 hinges are for use on 1-3/4 inch thick wood doors. Package includes one (1) hinge with matching finish  #10 x 1-1/2 inch wood screws. When the door is closed, SOSS Invisible Hinges cannot be seen or tampered with. When opened, the riveted hinge pin is non-removable. The installed hinge is firmly anchored in a deep, full mortise, which assists the screws in supporting the door, assuring a stronger door hinge installation.",
